                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb0fbf19-6288-3b20-af3f-01e35e4c0921",
                        "entry_id": "ef243a84-c27b-3f34-b3f3-68a628381ac7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A ringing sound, as of metal or glass being struck."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "957011cb-4b44-4cea-ab72-722fafa0299a",
                                "sense_id": "eb0fbf19-6288-3b20-af3f-01e35e4c0921",
                                "text": "The hoe banged against a spade on the wall, making a loud \"ching!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c329d8d-120e-4cc7-bb02-19112416349e",
                                "sense_id": "eb0fbf19-6288-3b20-af3f-01e35e4c0921",
                                "text": "\"To predictions coming true,\" Riley agreed, touching her rim to his with a quiet ching of crystal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8efb1b21-8853-4345-8bab-c54be9144347",
                                "sense_id": "eb0fbf19-6288-3b20-af3f-01e35e4c0921",
                                "text": "Joseph gulped and drew his sword with a loud ching."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "020c0540-6f42-3746-b0ee-fe3e1bb3ad11",
                        "entry_id": "ef243a84-c27b-3f34-b3f3-68a628381ac7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Money (from the sound of a cash register ringing up an amount)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b825c44e-b2f3-43d9-9131-3ab8eccaf6bb",
                                "sense_id": "020c0540-6f42-3746-b0ee-fe3e1bb3ad11",
                                "text": "\"Supposedly, it was worth millions back then, so it could be worth maybe ten times as much now.\"\nTatorrio whistled. \"That's a lot of ching.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06b31a78-56b3-456a-838e-21b700822bf6",
                                "sense_id": "020c0540-6f42-3746-b0ee-fe3e1bb3ad11",
                                "text": "If there are any people owing you money, it's a good time to drive to their houses and look for your \"ching\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cca9c2cd-4032-4c6f-bccf-28eaa138ac02",
                                "sense_id": "020c0540-6f42-3746-b0ee-fe3e1bb3ad11",
                                "text": "Jimmy, Jimmy, Jimmy / Hold onto your ching"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67c9154f-8f4e-4f9c-aa0f-2aef2c7cf3fc",
                                "sense_id": "020c0540-6f42-3746-b0ee-fe3e1bb3ad11",
                                "text": "If you know how to play your cards when buying, you can definitely save some ching here, especially on bigger ops."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
