                                "sense_id": "9f95f637-8413-374a-83c6-97c5aa80ef20",
                                "text": "No verbal, just chinging, like everyone know that we are on tings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dec69da6-02de-402c-bb21-8674f6f3a469",
                                "sense_id": "9f95f637-8413-374a-83c6-97c5aa80ef20",
                                "text": "Stickin' 'em, none of my niggas are innocent. (On s-, on s-) On sight man are just chinging him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04ac3a08-6187-4349-927b-35c562d5c398",
                                "sense_id": "9f95f637-8413-374a-83c6-97c5aa80ef20",
